.env
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Native `android/` / `ios/` are committed so dev-client + Gradle edits (e.g. MainActivity) are reproducible.
# Regenerate with `npx expo prebuild` when needed; `android/.gitignore` still excludes `local.properties`, `build/`, `.gradle/`.
